{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"038ad973-9590-4020-bd2c-9109cf320be8","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented proper caching for the system prompt so that a `save_fact` write no longer evicts the static instructions.\n\nYou can see the detailed change summary in the artifact:\n\n**[ANSWER.md](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/038ad973-9590-4020-bd2c-9109cf320be8/ANSWER.md)**\n\nThe modification was made in **[bot.py](file:///tmp/h-abZkLq/bot.py#L130-L137)**, where the system prompt is now split into:\n\n1. **Static instructions** – cached forever with `{\"type\": \"static\"}`.  \n2. **Dynamic athlete context** – sent without caching to reflect updated facts.\n\nThis prevents the full‑price penalty on subsequent calls after a memory write.\n","duration_seconds":19.835543,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":14373,"output_tokens":1709,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":48448,"total_tokens":16082}}}
